  "content_html": "<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/assets/images/content/43c3929558884f8636.jpg\"><img alt=\"פעוט מודד בסרגל מידה את אורכה של שפופרת משחת השיניים\" border=\"0\" height=\"320\" src=\"/assets/images/content/43c3929558884f8636.jpg\" width=\"320\" /></a></div><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">וגם, מה מקור השם חשמונאים?</span></h2><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><blockquote><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">בְּשָׂמִים לְשֶׁמֶן הַמִּשְׁחָה</span></blockquote></div><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br style=\"background-color: white; color: #222222;\" /></span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🏺</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; color: #222222;\">שמן&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; color: #222222; text-align: center;\"><b>הַמִּשְׁחָה</b>,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"color: #222222;\">נועד <b>לִמְשֹׁחַ</b> או <b>לִמְרֹחַ</b>&nbsp;(בהחלפות האותיות השיניות ש-ר) את כלי המשכן.</span></span></span></span></p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">☝️</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"color: #222222;\"><b>הַמְּשִׁיחָה</b>&nbsp;נעשית באמצעות <b>מְשִׁיכָה</b>&nbsp;של השמן באצבע.</span></span><br style=\"background-color: white; color: #222222;\" /><span style=\"background-color: white; color: #222222;\">במסכת הוריות נכתב: \"שמתחיל למשוח באצבעו בין ריסי עיניו, ומושך אצבעו על הראש והולך, עד שמגיע לעורף\".<span><br /></span></span><br style=\"background-color: white; color: #222222;\" /></span><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🧢</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; color: #222222;\">לדעת הרמב\"ם, נעשית&nbsp;</span></span><b style=\"background-color: white; color: #222222; font-family: arial;\">הַמְּשִׁיחָה</b><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; color: #222222;\">&nbsp;על המצח.</span><br style=\"background-color: white; color: #222222;\" /><span style=\"background-color: white; color: #222222;\">מעניין האם יש קשר בין המילים <b>מצח-משח</b>?</span><br style=\"background-color: white; color: #222222;\" /><span style=\"background-color: white; color: #222222;\">יש כאן חילוף בין האותיות השיניות צ-ש.</span><br style=\"background-color: white; color: #222222;\" /><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"color: #222222;\">בנוסף, <b>מִתְמַשֵּׁךְ</b>&nbsp;לו ה<b>מֵצַח</b>&nbsp;מצד לצד...</span></span><br style=\"background-color: white; color: #222222;\" /><br style=\"background-color: white; color: #222222;\" /></span><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">📏</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"color: #222222;\">מידותיו של חפץ, נמדדות עפ\"י <b>מֶשֶׁךְ</b>&nbsp;(מידת) צלעותיו (אורכו ורחבו).</span></span><br style=\"background-color: white; color: #222222;\" /><span style=\"background-color: white; color: #222222;\">המילה הארמית <b>מִשְׁחָא</b> - משמשת גם ל-שמן וגם ל-מידה.</span><br style=\"background-color: white; color: #222222;\" /><span style=\"background-color: white; color: #222222;\">אגב, גם בעברית, נקרא החבל המשמש למדידה -&nbsp;</span></span><b style=\"background-color: white; color: #222222; font-family: arial;\">מְּשִׁיחָה</b><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; color: #222222;\">.</span><br style=\"background-color: white; color: #222222;\" /><br style=\"background-color: white; color: #222222;\" /></span><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🦵</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"color: #222222;\">בעבר, היו נוהגים <b>לָסוּךְ</b>&nbsp;את הגוף בשמן. המילים <b>למשוח ולמסוך</b> הן קרובות.</span></span><br style=\"background-color: white; color: #222222;\" /><span style=\"background-color: white; color: #222222;\">יש בהן חילוף אותיות שיניות ש-ס, כמו גם ח-ך.</span><br style=\"background-color: white; color: #222222;\" /><br style=\"background-color: white; color: #222222;\" /></span><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">💥</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"color: #222222;\">כאשר עור כפות הידיים <b>פָּשׁוּחַ</b>&nbsp;(מבוקע) - <b>מוֹשְׁחִים/מוֹרְחִים</b>&nbsp;אותו בקרם או <b>מִשְׁחָה</b>.</span></span><br style=\"background-color: white; color: #222222;\" /><span style=\"background-color: white; color: #222222;\">במילים <b>פשוח ומשוח</b>, נחלפו האותיות פ-מ (האותיות השפתיות בומ\"פ).</span><br style=\"background-color: white; color: #222222;\" /><br style=\"background-color: white; color: #222222;\" /></span><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">👑</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; color: #222222;\">גם את המלכים היו נוהגים&nbsp;</span></span><b style=\"background-color: white; color: #222222; font-family: arial;\">לִמְשֹׁחַ</b><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; color: #222222;\">&nbsp;בשמן&nbsp;</span></span><b style=\"color: #222222; font-family: arial; text-align: center;\">הַמִּשְׁחָה</b><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; color: #222222;\">.</span><br style=\"background-color: white; color: #222222;\" /><span style=\"background-color: white; color: #222222;\">על הפסוק \"לְךָ נְתַתִּים <b>לְמָשְׁחָה</b> וּלְבָנֶיךָ לְחָק עוֹלָם\", כתב רש\"י <b>למשחה</b> - לגדולה.</span><br style=\"background-color: white; color: #222222;\" /><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"color: #222222;\">זהו גם מקור שמם של <b>הַחַשְׁמוֹנָאִים</b>. לשון זו מעידה על גדולתם.</span></span><br style=\"background-color: white; color: #222222;\" /><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"color: #222222;\">להבדיל, גם ראשי הכנסייה קרויים <b>חַשְׁמַנִּים</b>.</span></span><br style=\"background-color: white; color: #222222;\" /><br style=\"background-color: white; color: #222222;\" /></span><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">📖</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"color: #222222;\">אנו מחכים ומתפללים לביאת <b>הַמָּשִׁיחַ</b>, שעתיד <b>לְהִמָּשַׁח</b> בְּשֶׁמֶן <b>הַמִּשְׁחָה</b>.</span></span><br style=\"background-color: white; color: #222222;\" /><br style=\"background-color: white; color: #222222;\" /></span><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">5️⃣</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; color: #222222;\">אגב, כדאי לדעת, ש</span></span><span style=\"background-color: white; color: #222222; font-family: arial;\">שֶׁמֶן&nbsp;</span><b style=\"background-color: white; color: #222222; font-family: arial;\">הַמִּשְׁחָה</b><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"color: #222222;\">, נעשה מ<b>חֲמִשָּׁה</b>&nbsp;(היפוך אותיות) רכיבים:&nbsp;<br /></span></span><span style=\"color: #222222;\">שֶׁמֶן זַיִת, מֹר, קִנָּמוֹן, קִדָּה וּקְנֵה בֹּשֶׂם</span><br style=\"background-color: white; color: #222222;\" /><br style=\"background-color: white; color: #222222;\" /></span><span style=\"color: #202122; font-family: Rubik; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🤕</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white; color: #222222;\">ולסיום, האין זה משעשע, שאנו מורחים&nbsp;</span></span><b style=\"background-color: white; color: #222222; font-family: arial;\">מִּשְׁחָה</b><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"color: #222222;\">&nbsp;נגד כאבים ו<b>מִחוּשִׁים</b>?</span></span></span></span>"
}
